1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,340
(Kefu.)

17
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:53,500
(Troupe Master Yu Qing'en's Grave)
(The day has finally come.)

18
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:26,220
=Episode 8=

19
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,920
These old bones of mine...

20
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,920
If I don't get acupuncture from you

21
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,720
every now and then,

22
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,800
I can barely get by.

23
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,280
Governor,
you have so much on your shoulders.

24
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,280
You work far too hard.

25
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,920
Fancheng is fortunate to have you.

26
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,440
Father.

27
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,080
Since you've worked so hard,

28
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:30,040
why not step down while you're ahead?

29
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,280
You ungrateful son!

30
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,720
Get on your knees!

31
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,800
(Kefu.)

32
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,440
(Those are gunshots.)

33
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,880
(Can you hear them?)

34
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:22,600
(The man who killed you will pay today.)

35
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,000
(Why are there so many gunshots?)

36
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:42,720
I raised you all these years,

37
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,280
and this is how you repay me?

38
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,640
Repay you?

39
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,400
Lu Zhentian.

40
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,840
If you weren't such a ruthless killer,

41
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,760
would I have had to get my mother killed

42
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,720
just to stay alive?

43
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:59,440
Would I have ended up
with this shameful affliction?

44
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,600
Lu Zhentian.

45
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,720
No one wants you dead more than I do.

46
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,040
You're as foolish as your mother.

47
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,360
Think about it.

48
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,680
If I wanted you dead,

49
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,720
it'd be easier than crushing an ant.

50
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,200
Shoot him.

51
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,080
Governor.

52
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:20,280
(The mantis stalks the cicada,
and the oriole waits behind.)

53
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:24,440
(Tomorrow, I'll be that oriole.)

54
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,440
(If your plan fails tomorrow,)

55
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:27,960
(I'll make sure)

56
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:30,080
(every gun pointed at you)

57
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,720
(is held by one of our men.)

58
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,520
(That way, nothing can go wrong.)

59
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:35,960
Jingchen.

60
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,400
What are you waiting for?

61
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,120
Shoot him.

62
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:43,920
We'll see who dies today.

63
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,560
(But now...)

64
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,880
(I've never seen any of the men)

65
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,920
(pointing guns at Lu Shaoyun.)

66
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,640
Useless fool.

67
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,440
(You're one step ahead.)

68
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,400
(The mantis stalks the cicada;
the oriole waits behind.)

69
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,280
(If anything goes wrong tomorrow,)

70
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,480
(I'll be counting on you.)

71
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,640
(Lu Shaoyun,)

72
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,800
(you killed Lin Kefu,)

73
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,640
(brutalized innocent civilians,)

74
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,160
(and abused innocent women.)

75
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,400
(You're getting what you deserve today.)

76
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,640
(And the way out I mentioned yesterday)

77
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,520
(was only for me.)

78
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,560
I never expected the young master

79
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,600
to harbor such intentions.

80
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:06,240
What a way to repay you
for raising him.

81
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,120
Good thing I was prepared.

82
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:12,920
Otherwise, that mad dog
would've bitten me.

83
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,680
I failed in my duty.

84
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,360
I gave you a fright, Governor.

85
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,280
(He actually wasn't exposed.)

86
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,160
(How did he pull that off?)

87
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:23,440
Jingchen.

88
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:27,080
Just now,
you hesitated for quite a while.

89
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,960
Why wouldn't you fire?

90
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:32,560
After all, you raised him as your son
for 20 years.

91
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,000
And I called him Young Master
for over a decade.

92
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:40,600
I was wrong.

93
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,400
I shouldn't have been softhearted.

94
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,520
I disappointed you.

95
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,920
I wouldn't say that.

96
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:52,640
I used to value
that traitor's ruthlessness.

97
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,200
But I forgot

98
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:58,280
the ruthless are often ungrateful.

99
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,200
You're different.

100
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,880
You have a conscience.

101
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,960
You understand loyalty and gratitude.

102
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,000
Thank you, Governor.

103
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,440
I'll strengthen security at
the Governor's Residence at once.

104
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,440
We can keep outsiders out,

105
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,160
but not a traitor within.

106
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,400
Yutang.

107
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:18,840
Why are you standing there?

108
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,720
Come here.

109
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,480
Father.

110
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,720
I heard there was some trouble,

111
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,560
so I made you tea to calm your nerves.

112
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:33,440
How thoughtful.

113
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,040
Come inside, both of you.

114
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,120
I have something to say.

115
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,680
Yes.

116
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,720
(Governor's Residence)
Yutang.

117
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,200
From today on,

118
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,720
the Governor's Residence
has only a daughter

119
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,600
and no son.

120
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:54,440
What happened to my brother?

121
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,360
Don't call that traitor your brother.

122
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,000
Jingchen.

123
00:07:57,520 --> 00:08:00,120
From now on, you're responsible
for Yutang's safety.

124
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,120
Yes.

125
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:02,720
Yutang.

126
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,240
Jingchen is loyal and devoted.

127
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,720
I trust him with your safety.

128
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,160
I can rest easy.

129
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,880
(She actually wasn't exposed either.)

130
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:13,120
(Then how did Lu Zhentian
start suspecting Lu Shaoyun?)

131
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,800
(Was it Lu Zhentian
who killed Lu Shaoyun,)

132
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,280
(or did this man sacrifice an ally)

133
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,640
(to win Lu Zhentian's trust)

134
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,120
(and save himself?)

135
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,800
(He Jingchen,)

136
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,720
(you're even more
formidable than I thought.)

137
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:31,000
You two need to listen to me.

138
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,520
Yes, Father.

139
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:33,800
Yes, Governor.

140
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,080
Jingchen, get back to work.

141
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:37,320
Yes.

142
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:50,680
Just now,

143
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,200
you pretended to know nothing.

144
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:55,000
How did you know

145
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,680
I hadn't told Jingchen

146
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:00,640
that this trap was your idea,

147
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,240
or

148
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,520
you were working with that traitor?

149
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:10,000
After what happened with Lu Shaoyun,

150
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,040
I figured you'd never fully trust
anyone again.

151
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,400
Good.

152
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,600
You really take after me.

153
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,280
Did I pass your test?

154
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,200
I already told you.

155
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:24,680
In the Governor's Residence,

156
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:27,080
I have only one daughter.

157
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,760
Besides, that traitor is dead.

158
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:33,400
Who would know whether
your identity is real or fake?

159
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,640
Father, have some tea.

160
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:52,520
By the way,

161
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,680
those two people
Lady Feng brought back...

162
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,240
Since they were after you,

163
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,920
I'll leave them to you.

164
00:10:20,470 --> 00:10:24,800
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

165
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:29,800
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

166
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:32,420
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

167
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:35,500
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

168
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:39,620
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

169
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:45,580
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

170
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:50,500
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

171
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,860
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

172
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:56,420
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

173
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:59,420
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

174
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:05,940
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

175
00:11:06,420 --> 00:11:09,740
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

176
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:12,980
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

177
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:19,740
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

178
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:23,020
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

179
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:26,460
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

180
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:28,580
♪Boundless♪
